# NEVER commit trader data, or anything derived from one trader's history.
# Tradebooks and per-trader findings live outside this repo, under the deletion
# runbook (docs/runbooks/data-deletion.md). Git history cannot be deleted on
# request, so a trader fact committed here breaks the promise made to recruits.
data/raw/
data/partners/
data/private/
# Corpus A regenerates from code + seed + the logged price file; only its manifest
# digest is recorded (scripts/build_corpus_a.py).
data/corpus/
raw/
private/
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.zip

# Synthetic fixtures and their goldens are the only data files allowed.
# They contain no real trader's trades.
!data/fixtures/**
!data/golden/**

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Build output
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
